FLAW 5: A01 Broken Access Control / Cross-site request forgery CSFR 

https://github.com/jesundma/CyberSecurity-HU-Course-Project-I/blob/master/library/views.py#L113
https://github.com/jesundma/CyberSecurity-HU-Course-Project-I/blob/master/library/templates/library/change_password.html#L57

